1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Need to move files from your PC to your
phone?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Meet Line: share files between Windows and
Android,

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,000
with no account or cloud storage.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Nearby connects devices on the same local
network.

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Internet mode needs a reachable public
address and compatible network access.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
On your PC, choose Nearby.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Click Choose files and select your files.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Then click Create sharing room.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Your device hosts the room.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Share the full invitation and the
temporary eight-digit code.

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
On the other device, open Receive.

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Paste the invitation and enter the code.

13
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Then tap Join room.

14
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Compare the security codes on both
screens.

15
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Then tap Accept and receive.

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Keep Line running and watch the progress
on both devices.

17
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Your files travel encrypted.

18
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
On Android, save a copy to a folder on
your phone.

19
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Line. Your files. No detours.
